<section class="py-5 task-management-hero curve-style">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-7" data-aos="fade-up">
                {include file="inc/landing-pages/inc/logo.tpl" linkDescribedBy="task management landing page logo link"}

                <span class="badge task-management-badge rounded-pill px-3 py-2 mb-3">Task Management</span>

                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">
                    Stop Managing Projects In Spreadsheets
                </h1>

                <p class="lead mb-4">Spreadsheets are great for lists, but they fall apart when your team needs to assign tasks, track progress, measure time, and keep projects moving. Skale helps businesses move from messy spreadsheets to task management systems that are easier to use, easier to measure, and easier to scale.</p>

                <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Project Tracking</div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Task Assignments</div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Progress Visibility</div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Time Tracking Insights</div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Free & Paid Tool Guidance</div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">&check; Custom Workflow Setup</div>
                </div>

                {include file="inc/landing-pages/inc/modal-button.tpl" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4" text="Get My Task Management Plan" describedBy="task management landing page" metaEvent="TaskManagement" metaLabel="Hero CTA Button"}
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div id="strategy-session" class="form-panel p-4 p-lg-5">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-2">Get Your Free Workflow Strategy Session</h3>
                    <p class="text-tertiary mb-4">We’ll review how you currently manage tasks and identify better ways to organize projects, assign work, and track team progress.</p>

                    {include file="inc/landing-pages/inc/lead-contact-form.tpl" buttonText="Get My Free Automation Review" userMessageLabel="What process feels too manual right now?"}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <span class="badge task-management-badge rounded-pill px-3 py-2 mb-3">Why Upgrade</span>
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold">
                Spreadsheets Track Data.<br>
                Task Management Systems Drive Action.
            </h2>
            <p class="lead text-tertiary mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">When work is managed in spreadsheets, updates get missed, ownership becomes unclear, and progress is hard to measure. A task management system creates one central place for projects, tasks, deadlines, responsibilities, and performance insights.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <div class="card h-100 p-4 bg-light text-secondary">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark">Clear Ownership</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0">Assign tasks to specific users so everyone knows who owns what and what needs to happen next.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div class="card h-100 p-4 bg-light text-secondary">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark">Project Visibility</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0">See project status, blockers, due dates, priorities, and completed work without digging through rows and tabs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                <div class="card h-100 p-4 bg-light text-secondary">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark">Better Reporting</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0">Track average task times, completion rates, overdue items, and recurring bottlenecks that slow the team down.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                <div class="card h-100 p-4 bg-light text-secondary">
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark">Scalable Process</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0">Create repeatable workflows your team can follow as your business, clients, and workload grow.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light text-secondary">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <span class="badge task-management-badge rounded-pill px-3 py-2 mb-3">Free vs Paid Options</span>
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold text-dark">You Don’t Always Need Expensive Software</h2>
            <p class="lead text-tertiary mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">The right solution depends on your team size, workflow complexity, reporting needs, and how much automation you want. We help you choose the right setup instead of overbuying tools you do not need.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold text-light">Free Task Management Tools</h3>
                        <p class="text-tertiary">Best for small teams or businesses just moving away from spreadsheets.</p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled text-secondary">
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Basic task lists and boards</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Assign tasks to team members</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Set due dates and priorities</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Simple project views</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Good starting point for organizing work</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Best fit:</strong> Small teams, simple workflows, early-stage process improvements.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold text-light">Paid Task Management Systems</h3>
                        <p class="text-tertiary">Best for teams that need automation, reporting, permissions, integrations, and better visibility.</p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled text-secondary">
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Advanced dashboards and reporting</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Time tracking and workload tracking</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Automations and recurring workflows</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Integrations with CRM, email, calendars, and other tools</li>
                            <li class="mb-2">&check; Better controls for teams, clients, and departments</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-0"><strong>Best fit:</strong> Growing teams, client work, operational reporting, and scalable workflows.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

